* 1989, 1990, 1991 Nominees: [[Grammy Award for Best Male Rock Vocal Performance]]
* 1993 Nominee: [[Brit Awards|Brit Award]] for Best British Male
* 1998, 1999, 2013, 2014 Nominees: [[Echo (music award)|Echo]]

