The {{nihongo|'''''Huis Ten Bosch'''''|ハウステンボス|Hausutenbosu}} is a [[limited express]] train service operated by [[Kyushu Railway Company]] (JR Kyushu) in Japan. It runs between [[Hakata Station]] in [[Fukuoka, Fukuoka]], and [[Huis Ten Bosch Station]], the station for the [[Huis Ten Bosch (theme park)|Huis Ten Bosch]] theme park in [[Sasebo, Nagasaki]].

==History==
''Huis Ten Bosch'' services started on 25 March 1992.<ref name="meikan1995">{{cite book | title = 列車名鑑1995 |trans-title=Train Name Directory 1995| publisher = Railway Journal| date = August 1995 | location = Japan| page = 128| isbn = }}</ref>

